<title>USA: CapStar Hotel Co Q1 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>CapStar Hotel Co Q1 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997	  1996</p>
<p>				     Actual	Pro Forma</p>
<p> Total Revenue		   48,107,821  29,156,360</p>
<p> Net Income			 1,940,080   1,128,430</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share		    0.14	  0.09</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1996 pro forma results include hotel acquisitions.</p>
<p>The company said in Q1 1997 it issued 5,750,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
